                    "value": "AC2   ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Non-IBAN account numbers that contain a currency code use the bank country's local currency (13.3% contain a code; 99.6% of those = local currency)",
