                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Each sender account number belongs to one bank and one party type; some receiver numbers recur under several banks, so accounts are keyed by (BIC8, account) (multi-BIC: sender 0.00%, receiver 2.38%; multi-type 0.00%)",
